# Write the animal file

## Job

Write the animal file for one species: its body, behaviour, food, year
and English text, in the shape of the example animals.

## Input

The surveyed species:

```
{
  "species": "snow_bunting",
  "latin": "Plectrophenax nivalis",
  "habitats": [
    "tundra"
  ],
  "size": {
    "length_cm": 16.0,
    "weight_kg": 0.035
  },
  "year": {
    "food": "Through the year it eats seeds, and in summer it also eats small insects.",
    "shelter": "It shelters in small holes between rocks. The nest sits warm and safe in a rock hole.",
    "winter": "migrates",
    "young": "Young are born in summer. They stay warm in the nest and grow fast."
  },
  "foods": [
    {
      "kind": "seeds",
      "name": "seeds",
      "note": "Seeds sit on the ground. The bird picks them up."
    },
    {
      "kind": "insects",
      "name": "insects",
      "note": "It eats small insects in summer."
    },
    {
      "kind": "grass",
      "name": "grasses",
      "note": "It eats soft green grasses."
    },
    {
      "kind": "berries",
      "name": "fruits",
      "note": "It eats soft sweet fruits."
    }
  ],
  "looks": {
    "coat": {
      "belly": "white",
      "belly_hex": "#FFFFFF",
      "main": "white",
      "main_hex": "#FFFFFF",
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Snow_bunting"
    },
    "height_cm": 16.0,
    "height_source": "https://www.nwt.org.uk/wildlife-explorer/birds/snow-bunting",
    "marks": [
      {
        "mark": "black back",
        "source": "https://www.npolar.no/en/species/snow-bunting/"
      },
      {
        "mark": "large white wing patches",
        "source": "https://earthlife.net/snow-buntings"
      },
      {
        "mark": "white outer tail feathers",
        "source": "https://animals.jrank.org/pages/858/New-World-Finches-Emberizidae-SNOW-BUNTING-PLECTROPHENAX-NIVALIS-SPECIES-ACCOUNTS.html"
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

